  {
   "id": "cb_72f3a0f8a5c52058375328f4",
   "order": 2,
   "title_en": "Excellent First-layer Adhesion and Improved Durability",
   "body_en": "After optimizing the manufacturing process of the Bambu Texture PEI Plate, the durability of the plate is enhanced. Additionally, the adhesion between the prints and the plate is significantly improved, eliminating the need for adhesives.\n*In some situations, glue is required for very specific filaments",
   "url": "",
   "source_media_id": "",
   "source_url": "",
   "alt_en": "",
   "alt_ar": "",
   "alt_ckb": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "section_kind": "overview",
   "section_path": "html › 1"
  },
  {
   "id": "cb_3683e4b44fa0c5e2ed2dafd7",
   "order": 3,
   "title_en": "",
   "body_en": "",
   "url": "",
   "source_media_id": "content:c5bfee43a760b1b097840c2c",
   "source_url": "https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/d8f55e8e969a4a1085edc13dbe5de492/Group_2307.png",
   "alt_en": "Bambu Textured PEI Plate",
   "alt_ar": "صورة Bambu Textured PEI Plate",
   "alt_ckb": "وێنەی Bambu Textured PEI Plate",
   "kind": "image",
   "section_kind": "overview",
   "section_path": "html › 1"
  },
  {
   "id": "cb_feceb77a904e15a5b9da705d",
   "order": 4,
   "title_en": "Self-release when Cooled Down",
   "body_en": "PEI is an excellent material for 3D printing applications due to its ability to withstand the repeated heating and cooling cycles of a printer heatbed. Prints come off easily when the temperature of the heatbed reaches room temperature, and we always recommend waiting until it reaches 35℃ or lower. If the print still adheres to the plate, simply bend the steel plate and the model will fall right into your hands.",
   "url": "",
   "source_media_id": "",
   "source_url": "",
   "alt_en": "",
   "alt_ar": "",
   "alt_ckb": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "section_kind": "overview",
   "section_path": "html › 2"
  },
  {
   "id": "cb_ef0167d10998bcb4496a0400",
   "order": 5,
   "title_en": "",
   "body_en": "",
   "url": "",
   "source_media_id": "content:e85b8f06445344a7ef1cf5c6",
   "source_url": "https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/8d8cb8b996d84ec68b9225e04515adf6/20230711-145849.gif",
   "alt_en": "Bambu Textured PEI Plate",
   "alt_ar": "صورة Bambu Textured PEI Plate",
   "alt_ckb": "وێنەی Bambu Textured PEI Plate",
   "kind": "image",
   "section_kind": "overview",
   "section_path": "html › 2"
  },
  {
   "id": "cb_1c87bf83d6e3c1dbd1ca82e0",
   "order": 6,
   "title_en": "Reliable Magnetic Adhesion to Prevent Warping",
   "body_en": "The Bambu Texture PEI Plate features a 0.5mm-thick stainless steel plate that enhances magnetic adhesion. This helps to prevent warping and ensure optimal print quality during 3D printing, reducing the likelihood of the first layer detaching due to deformation. It also helps when printing larger models with materials that are prone to warping like ABS, PC and Nylon.",
   "url": "",
   "source_media_id": "",
   "source_url": "",
   "alt_en": "",
   "alt_ar": "",
   "alt_ckb": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "section_kind": "overview",
   "section_path": "html › 4"
  },
  {
   "id": "cb_88a7652f30321ddfa11a2bfc",
   "order": 7,
   "title_en": "",
   "body_en": "",
   "url": "",
